<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 11,098 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  210   (208 and 230)</p>
<p>    Good		140   (136 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     120   (120 and 112)</p>
<p>    Medium	    109   (107 and  83)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 85   ( 85 and  70)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 210 pence for a North Indian PF.</p>
</text>
